{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19102210","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19102210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910221001:1":{"text":"ここが外部海域なんだね……","source_cn":"这就是传说中的外部海域啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E0040D864C02A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910221002:0":{"text":"この辺でマリシアンが失踪したことがあるんだって。だから、ばあばもお母さんもお姉ちゃんも、一人で来ちゃダメって言うし、一緒にも来てくれないの。","source_cn":"因为有海裔在附近失踪过，阿嬷、妈妈、沫霖姐姐都说这里危...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5F7595EB720A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910221003:0":{"text":"外海の話はいっぱい聞いてたから、やっと来られて嬉しい！行きたかった場所、ぜーんぶ回っちゃお！","source_cn":"听了那么多有关它的事情，终于能来这里了。我一定要把之前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE96A353E7745AB75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910221004:1":{"text":"外海に出ると、エフィラは水を得た魚のように、洞窟に潜ったり、水草に触れたりと、傘を器用に動かしながら辺りを泳ぎ回った。","source_cn":"刚一进入外海，艾菲拉便如同归海的游鱼般，钻钻这个洞窟、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6AECA2065EBEC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910221005:1":{"text":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令家族代表们无比忌惮的这处外部海域，与你们曾去过的围猎地并没有什么太大区别。","source_cn":"随着她的身影，你谨慎地打量着四周。但与你想象的不同，令...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x80B7513530F7957C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910221006:0":{"text":"何がそんなに嬉しいんだ？他の海と同じじゃねえか。","source_cn":"哪值得好奇了？这和其他海不是没两样吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x587CC12E5471CE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910221007:0":{"text":"水進機に使えそうな材料も見当たんねえし。外海ってのも大したことねえじゃん。","source_cn":"也没啥能用来修理水行器的特别材料。这就是外海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263169D979A2837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1910221007":{"text":"水進機に使えそうな材料も見当たんねえし。外海ってのも大したことねえじゃん。","source_cn":"也没啥特别的材料。这就是外海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263169D979A2837A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910221008:1":{"text":"ばあばが言ってたの。一人で外海に出たマリシアンが、何人か失踪してるから。","source_cn":"阿嬷是这么说的。因为，独自外出的海裔，偶尔会在外部海域失踪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7FEB08B9F1349D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910221010:1":{"text":"二十年前も、あたしたちの世代で一番年上のお兄ちゃんが、ここで行方不明になったって、ばあばが言ってた。","source_cn":"阿嬷说，在二十年前，我们这辈最年长的哥哥，就是在这里失踪的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD27DB277017AF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1910221011:1":{"text":"行方不明？厄介な海獣にでも出くわしたのか？","source_cn":"失踪？难道撞上解决不了的大鱼怪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B4F3A50630D57A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1910221012:1":{"text":"みんなも最初はそう思ってたんだって。でも、ばあばたちが何度探しに来ても、そんな生き物は見つからなかったらしいよ。","source_cn":"一开始大家也是这么猜的，但阿嬷她们出来找了好几次，都没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E9137C16E90FF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1910221013:1":{"text":"それに、本当に海獣がいたとしても、マリシアンなら絶対に抵抗するはずだよ。","source_cn":"而且，就算我们海裔真的遇到大鱼怪，在被抓走前也一定会反击的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76DB9249686780A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910221014:1":{"text":"でも、どこにも戦ったような跡はなかったんだって……まるで、お兄ちゃんが突然消えたみたいだって言ってた。","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0614835EFE0DA5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1910221014":{"text":"でも、どこにも戦ったような跡はなかったんだって……まるで、お兄ちゃんが突然消えたみたいだって言ってた。","source_cn":"但阿嬷他们找了又找，这里却连一点搏斗的痕迹也没有……哥哥就像凭空消失了一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0614835EFE0DA5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910221015:1":{"text":"あたしも同じことを考えたんだけど……本当の事はもう誰にも分かんないよ。","source_cn":"我也这么猜过……但谁也不知道事实到底是怎样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EA4D08A3A92C220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910221016:1":{"text":"あれも違う、これも違う、何がなんだかさっぱりだな。","source_cn":"这也不对，那也说不通，真够玄乎的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB4E0B2CC8581C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910221017:1":{"text":"うん……だから、もう誰もここで狩りをしてないし、外海を調べようともしなくなったの。","source_cn":"是呀……之后，大家就不再来这里围猎，也不再调查藏在外海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x405E92BECF73610B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910221018:1":{"text":"でも、あたしはこのまま諦めちゃダメだと思う！","source_cn":"可我认为，不应该就这样放弃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7DB4531FF2DEC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1910221019:1":{"text":"だから、ずっとここに来てみたかったの。どうして家族は失踪したの？海獣じゃないなら、いったい何に連れ去られたの？みんなを探す方法はないの？","source_cn":"我一直想来这里看看，我想知道那些失踪的家人到底为什么会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x862CA6DE85DD8BFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1910221020:1":{"text":"ね！気になるでしょ！？","source_cn":"——我很好奇！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419BCF8C9A46C8DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1910221021:1":{"text":"分かった分かった、質問はそこまで！おいらもついでに探してやるから。","source_cn":"行行行！别再问了，咱知道了！咱待会顺便也帮你找找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5014AE776B94C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1910221022:1":{"text":"オットー！ありがとう！あたし――","source_cn":"图澜！谢谢你，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5893E8AC3DB22B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1910221023:1":{"text":"静かに！","source_cn":"别说话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EBA868CA4705EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1910221024:1":{"text":"あ、今のは質問じゃなくて、二人に感謝を――","source_cn":"放心，我不是想问问题，我是想向你们表达感谢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x763212D154296E83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1910221025:1":{"text":"そういう意味じゃねえって！あっちから物音がしたんだよ！","source_cn":"别说话！……不是，咱是说，那边有动静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC8B4CA1BFD429DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1910221026:1":{"text":"顺着图澜目光的方向，你们看到了一个被海草缠住的洞窟。","source_cn":"顺着图澜目光的方向，你们看到了一个被海草缠住的洞窟。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x1778FEEF799E6F7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1910221027:1":{"text":"辺りが静まると、周囲の物音がはっきり聞こえるようになった。オットーの聞き間違いではない。洞窟の奥から、かすかな音が聞こえてくる。","source_cn":"安静下来后，周围的声音变得格外清晰。图澜没有听错，洞窟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9882C690C3196589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1910221028:1":{"text":"途切れ途切れに響くそれは、風の音にも、人の泣き声にも聞こえる。","source_cn":"断断续续、呜呜咽咽，好似风声，又好似人哭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC7EA11EDEF4136","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1910221029:1":{"text":"だが、海底に風など吹くはずがない。","source_cn":"但海底是没有风的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3871B6BB98DA5FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1910221030:1":{"text":"もしかして、中に誰か閉じ込められてる……？","source_cn":"——是不是有人被困在里面了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FE913593B52C0FC","variant_status"